# Normalise line endings in the repository so that a diff shows real changes.
#
# Without this the analysis machine commits CRLF, a reader on another platform
# sees every line of every file as modified, and the release diff that is meant
# to make the work checkable becomes unreadable instead.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.csv text eol=lf
